. sg. अर्थयासे, RV. i, 82, 1);
 rarely cl. 1. Ā. (1. pl. अर्थामहे, MBh. iii, 8613) to strive to obtain, desire, wish, request, ask for (acc.; rarely Inf. [Bhaṭṭ. योद्धुम्]);
to supplicate or entreat any one (acc., rarely abl. [Kathās.]);
to point out the sense of, comment upon Comm. on Mṛcch.
